  "description": "Tamp CommandPlan wrappers for the ZAP DAST scanner (Apache-2.0). Drives the Automation Framework (declarative YAML plans covering contexts/auth, OpenAPI import, spider, AJAX spider, active scan, and native SARIF reporting) plus the packaged baseline/full/api scan scripts. Runs via the official Docker image by default — no JRE required on the runner — or against a local zap.sh install. Host-to-container path translation and env-var secret substitution included. Feeds SARIF straight into the Tamp security pipeline.",
